### `backend/src/routes/rooms.js` — Room Management

**Three endpoints:**

**`GET /api/rooms`** — Lists all rooms with live message counts
- Fetches room metadata from Supabase
- Then uses a **Redis pipeline** to fetch all `msgcount:{roomId}` keys in ONE round trip
- Without pipeline: 10 rooms × 20ms = 200ms. With pipeline: all 10 in one TCP packet = ~20ms

**`POST /api/rooms`** — Creates a new room (auth required)
- Uses `createUserClient` so RLS policy passes
- Generates a UUID for the room ID
- Returns the created room

**`GET /api/rooms/:roomId/history`** — Last 50 messages from Supabase
- Used when there's no Redis history (e.g., after a server restart)
- Joins with `profiles` table to include sender's avatar, color, display name
- Returns oldest-first (reversed after the Supabase query)

